    "# fire-and-forget. A destroy that fails prints a loud warning with the exact\n",
    "# scenario + working directory so it can be found and cleaned up by hand,\n",
    "# and is recorded with destroy_pass=False so it surfaces in the failure\n",
    "# analytics below rather than silently leaking.\n",
    "#\n",
    "# ⚠️  SAFETY GATE — this creates and destroys REAL, POSSIBLY BILLABLE AWS\n",
